# [CompliRules] KVKK Article 9 (2024 Reform) Cross-Border Data Transfer & Cloud Geo-Fencing
**Severity:** `CRITICAL` | **Jurisdiction:** `KVKK_TR`

## Legal Citations
- **6698 Sayılı KVKK (Madde 9 (12 Mart 2024 Reformu))**: Yurt dışına veri aktarımında Standart Sözleşme (SCC), BCR veya Kurul izni zorunluluğu. *[Sanction: KVKK Md. 18/1-e (1.000.000 TL - 5.000.000 TL idari para cezası) & TCK Md. 136 hapis yaptırımı.]*
- **Yurt Dışına Kişisel Veri Aktarımına İlişkin Usul ve Esaslar Hakkında Yönetmelik (Madde 14 (10 Temmuz 2024))**: Standart Sözleşmelerin (SCC) imzalanmasından itibaren 5 İŞ GÜNÜ İÇİNDE Kurul'a bildirilmesi zorunluluğu.

## Rule Mandates
- MUST: Route database storage and processing workloads involving Turkish resident personal data to in-country regions (e.g. TR-Central, EU Sovereign Cloud) by default.
- MUST: When using overseas cloud providers (AWS, Azure, Vercel) or LLM endpoints (OpenAI, Anthropic), verify that executed Standard Contractual Clauses (SCC) have been filed with the Personal Data Protection Board within 5 business days.
- MUST: Apply local pseudonymization or tokenization filters before transmitting user payloads to foreign APIs.
- MUST: Log data residency tags (`dataResidencyRegion: "TR"`) across database records and telemetry events.

## Forbidden Anti-Patterns
- NEVER: Transmitting raw, unmasked Turkish National IDs (TCKN) or user profiles directly to overseas LLM inference endpoints
- NEVER: Deploying primary customer databases to regions outside Turkey without an active SCC filing or Board authorization
- NEVER: Failing to log data sovereignty and residency routing metadata on cross-border API integrations

## Reference Compliant Code Snippets
### Geo-Routing ve SCC Bildirim Denetleyicisi
```ts
import { GeoRouter } from '@complirules/primitives';

export function routeUserDataTransfer(userCountry: 'TR', destinationCountry: 'US', hasScc: boolean) {
  const decision = GeoRouter.evaluateTransfer({
    originCountry: userCountry,
    destinationCountry,
    hasExecutedScc: hasScc
  });

  if (!decision.allowed) {
    throw new Error(`Yurt dışı aktarım engellendi: ${decision.reason}`);
  }

  if (decision.requiresKurulSccNotification) {
    console.log(`⚠️ DİKKAT: Standart Sözleşme ${decision.sccNotificationDeadlineBusinessDays} iş günü içinde Kurul'a bildirilmelidir!`);
  }
}
```
